What is the value of x at the end of the algorithm in pseudocode?

```
x <- 6;
y <- 5;
while x < 16 do
    x <- x + 2
endwhile
x <- x + y;
```

Parameters x and y of procedure h below are respectively passed by reference and by value. After the call h(a,b), what values do variables a and b hold?

```
proc h(x,y) =
    x <- x+y
    y <- 2*y;
end
a <- 6;
b <- 5;
h(a, b);
```
